//! | Pax sparse records on a header whose magic and version are not POSIX's | GNU tar extracts other data and no member after it; the others read the file | refused ([`Sparse`](crate::ErrorKind::Sparse)([`Magic`](crate::SparseFlaw::Magic))) | `sparse/a-sparse-file-in-pax-format-1.0-under-gnu-magic`, `sparse/a-sparse-file-in-pax-format-0.0-under-no-magic` |
